      "edition": "RVB Pushkin10vol1959-1962 online6.0 2019; acquired hash-pinned",
      "start": 264,
      "end": 314,
      "text": "Ты внемлешь грохоту громов,",
      "source_address": {
        "html_id": "L7",
        "section": "echo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "echo:8",
      "document_id": "echo",
      "document_sha256": "e04a015ccfbb225f9423e077d0038fd421fa31990b5124322c0918b17d1baf93",
      "edition": "RVB Pushkin10vol1959-1962 online6.0 2019; acquired hash-pinned",
      "start": 315,
      "end": 352,
      "text": "И гласу бури и валов,",
      "source_address": {
        "html_id": "L8",
        "section": "echo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "echo:9",
      "document_id": "echo",
      "document_sha256": "e04a015ccfbb225f9423e077d0038fd421fa31990b5124322c0918b17d1baf93",
      "edition": "RVB Pushkin10vol1959-1962 online6.0 2019; acquired hash-pinned",
      "start": 353,
      "end": 404,
      "text": "И крику сельских пастухов —",
      "source_address": {
        "html_id": "L9",
        "section": "echo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "echo:10",
      "document_id": "echo",
      "document_sha256": "e04a015ccfbb225f9423e077d0038fd421fa31990b5124322c0918b17d1baf93",
      "edition": "RVB Pushkin10vol1959-1962 online6.0 2019; acquired hash-pinned",
      "start": 405,
      "end": 431,
      "text": " И шлешь ответ;",
      "source_address": {
        "html_id": "L10",
        "section": "echo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "echo:11",
      "document_id": "echo",
      "document_sha256": "e04a015ccfbb225f9423e077d0038fd421fa31990b5124322c0918b17d1baf93",
      "edition": "RVB Pushkin10vol1959-1962 online6.0 2019; acquired hash-pinned",
      "start": 432,
      "end": 477,
      "text": "Тебе ж нет отзыва... Таков",
      "source_address": {
        "html_id": "L11",
        "section": "echo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "echo:12",
      "document_id": "echo",
      "document_sha256": "e04a015ccfbb225f9423e077d0038fd421fa31990b5124322c0918b17d1baf93",
      "edition": "RVB Pushkin10vol1959-1962 online6.0 2019; acquired hash-pinned",
      "start": 478,
      "end": 497,
      "text": " И ты, поэт!",
